plmswia-1e0633e0ce4bbe6d1e08d17e9847fd67fb081605,Sanction:startDate,2023-05-30,pl_mswia_sanctions,pol,30.05.2023,,,2025-04-28T19:38:23,2025-04-28T19:38:23
