plmswia-7a294fec49fe37f12eb9eba076d5e4117c5e1490,Sanction:entity,plmswia-osoby-panasiuk-vasil,pl_mswia_sanctions,pol,,,,2025-04-28T19:38:23,2025-04-28T19:38:23
plmswia-7a294fec49fe37f12eb9eba076d5e4117c5e1490,Sanction:country,pl,pl_mswia_sanctions,pol,,,,2025-04-28T19:38:23,2025-04-28T19:38:23
plmswia-7a294fec49fe37f12eb9eba076d5e4117c5e1490,Sanction:authority,Ministerstwo Spraw Wewnętrznych i Administracji,pl_mswia_sanctions,pol,,,,2025-04-28T19:38:23,2025-04-28T19:38:23
