plmswia-9dd5b3d340feb3b872ee49096ce3fa50870b41aa,Sanction:entity,plmswia-osoby-rutenka-siarhei,pl_mswia_sanctions,pol,,,,2025-04-28T19:38:23,2025-04-28T19:38:23
plmswia-9dd5b3d340feb3b872ee49096ce3fa50870b41aa,Sanction:country,pl,pl_mswia_sanctions,pol,,,,2025-04-28T19:38:23,2025-04-28T19:38:23
plmswia-9dd5b3d340feb3b872ee49096ce3fa50870b41aa,Sanction:authority,Ministerstwo Spraw Wewnętrznych i Administracji,pl_mswia_sanctions,pol,,,,2025-04-28T19:38:23,2025-04-28T19:38:23
